irmed to be immunologically stable (CD4 > 25%).\\nModerate-to-late preterm infants (gestational age > 31 weeks) and low-birth-weight infants (< 2500 g) who are healthy and clinically stable can receive BCG vaccination at birth, or at the latest, upon discharge."}]', label: 'rule 3', layer: 'l2-dmn', derivation: 'derived', skill: 'kg/extract-dmn'};
